<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background: #f6f6fb;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #ececf2;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 28px 26px;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .code {
            font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
            font-size: 34px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 10px;
            color: #4C1D95;
            background: #f2ecff;
            border: 1px solid #e0d4ff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 18px 12px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 22px 0;
        }

        .muted {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 26px;
            padding-top: 18px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            text-align: center;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="header">
                <h1 style="margin:0;font-size:22px;">Reset your password</h1>
            </div>

            <p>Hello <strong>{{userName}}</strong>,</p>

            <p>We received a request to reset your password. Enter this code to continue:</p>

            <div class="code">{{resetCode}}</div>

            <p class="muted">This code expires in <strong>{{expiryTime}}</strong> and can only be used once. For your security, it will lock after several incorrect attempts.</p>

            <p class="muted">If you didn&rsquo;t request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email &mdash; your password won&rsquo;t change.</p>

            <div class="footer">
                <p>&copy; {{year}} {{companyName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
